<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's CIADEA Q1 net $2.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's CIADEA Q1 net $2.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31. Net $2.6 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Ciadea SA, which makes Renault vehicles in Argentina under license, said first quarter results follow an extraordinary loss of $1.31 million.</p>
<p>The company provided neither comparatives nor EPS.</p>
<p>It said at March 31 its net worth stood at $389 million.</p>
<p>In the 12 months to December 31 it had reported a net profit of $61.06 million.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0650))</p>
</text>
